# On Sabbatical (crystalWar 32), the Progress rival at Prog 0: a level 99 Warrior in Bastok Markets [S] with On
# Sabbatical accepted (a GM: Prog 0, 46, a Progress) and Fires of Discontent accepted at Prog 5 (a GM: 160, a Progress),
# the WotG mission Adieu, Lilisette current and Back to the Beginning completed (GMs). Gentle Tiger plays 46 first,
# finished: On Sabbatical's Prog 1; then 47 (the lookup rotates the Progress replies: not 160); then 160 on the third
# trigger.
lists BastokMarketsS/Gentle_Tiger/onTrigger BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/46 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/160
char zone=BastokMarketsS pos=-202.432,-9.998,2.237 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning completed
mission Wotg AdieuLilisette current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
quest CrystalWar.OnSabbatical accepted          # a GM: Prog 0
quest CrystalWar.FiresOfDiscontent accepted     # a GM
charvar Quest[7][13]Prog 5                      # Fires: 160 (a Progress)
trigger Gentle_Tiger                            # 46 first
finish
trigger Gentle_Tiger                            # 47 (On Sabbatical's Prog 1), not 160
finish
trigger Gentle_Tiger                            # 160
finish
